大切なあの陽だまりが刹那に散りゆく景色
That precious sunny spot, a scenery scattering in an instant.

543
00:47:15,161 --> 00:47:22,161
今すべての力を与えたまえ
Now, grant me all of your strength,

544
00:47:22,461 --> 00:47:28,661
僕は瞳を逸らさずに
I will not avert my gaze,

545
00:47:29,561 --> 00:47:34,661
傷も涙も真実も
from the wounds, the tears, and the truth.

